{"id": "EUVD-2026-86209", "enisaUuid": "bf32fcca-2dcd-3ef3-a992-d71f43700ba9", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nPCI: altera: Protect root bus removal with rescan lock\n\nHold the pci_rescan_remove_lock lock while stopping and removing a root bus\nto avoid racing with concurrent rescan or hotplug operations triggered via\nsysfs.  Such races may lead to use-after-free issues or system crashes.\n\n[bhelgaas: commit log]", "datePublished": "2026-09-24T16:02:59", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-03T10:57:52", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cf9d84d1b6a7c3f3780c043df220a7e9e38137eb", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fc462f1bdeaea9789928cbfdf5e069ee559c7642", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/442b7f2a093b4a75f8963aaa7cbb2b8df35a6ac3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4b69c63cc247fc0f499fbd11076fee9c2a6e6fd7", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c0cd65906e5f7e293ef2568c9524cc0a918333c3", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7cbb8f2750d91e64caff89e164ac8280bb80bedc", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a8759c8ac48c0419f5899e95a6ffc611b07c965b"], "aliases": ["GHSA-4f4q-pcpx-7p8f", "CVE-2026-93821"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "035463c4-823e-3370-926b-7250f4df1d36", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 5.10.271"}, {"id": "09c68c02-26db-399a-bc89-cb9943a7e441", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ec15c4d0d5d2e431169fbdf6c6bcf0c8ff71ef22 <442b7f2a093b4a75f8963aaa7cbb2b8df35a6ac3"}, {"id": "2499300b-98de-3d94-8c25-6b16d1de2a29", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ec15c4d0d5d2e431169fbdf6c6bcf0c8ff71ef22 <4b69c63cc247fc0f499fbd11076fee9c2a6e6fd7"}, {"id": "40700058-d9cc-3f0e-b997-c17abdfa97c4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ec15c4d0d5d2e431169fbdf6c6bcf0c8ff71ef22 <fc462f1bdeaea9789928cbfdf5e069ee55